Winged Watcher	TYPE:Divine	SCHOOL:Transmutation	SUBSCHOOL:Polymorph	COMPS:V, S	CASTTIME:1 swift action	RANGE:Personal	TARGETAREA:You	DURATION:(CASTERLEVEL) rounds [D]

###Block: Descriptions
Animate Instrument.MOD	DESC:Your instrument animates and plays by itself.
Aquatic Escape.MOD	DESC:Take the form of a fish.
Armor Lock.MOD	DESC:Target's armor becomes restrictive, slowing movement to 10 ft.
Assassin's Darkness.MOD	DESC:Globe of pure darkness blocks all sight but your own.
Blockade.MOD	DESC:Fill 5-ft. square with enormous block of wood.
Catapult.MOD	DESC:Magically propel an object from your hand.
Create Fetch.MOD	DESC:Craft a temporary duplicate of yourself that follows telepathic orders.
Disobedience.MOD	DESC:Subject is shielded from mind control.
Enlarge Weapon.MOD	DESC:Your weapon grows one size category.
Evacuation Rune.MOD	DESC:Create invisible rune that you can teleport to as swift action.
Fatal Flame.MOD	DESC:Target's body bursts into flame upon its death.
Grasping Wall.MOD	DESC:Wall sprouts hands that entangle enemies, help allies climb.
Harmonic Void.MOD	DESC:Nearby casters must succeed on Concentration check to use verbal-component spells.
Healer's Vision.MOD	DESC:Gain +5 bonus on Heal checks, and +2 attack and damage on sneak attacks.
Lucky Streak.MOD	DESC:Target gains +2 luck bonus on rerolls made with luck feats.
Mage Burr.MOD	DESC:Double arcane spell failure chance for target's armor.
Manifestation of the Deity.MOD	DESC:Create illusion of your deity, rendering enemies shaken for 1 round.
Mimicry.MOD	DESC:Perfectly mimic familiar sounds, voices, or accents.
Opportune Dodge.MOD	DESC:Subject can avoid a single attack of opportunity.
Scry Location.MOD	DESC:Spy on a distant location.
Siphon.MOD	DESC:Drain 5 or more charges from wand or staff to replace one or more cast spells.
Smoke Stairs.MOD	DESC:Walk up a column of smoke as if it were solid.
Spell Theft.MOD	DESC:Dispel spells on target and gain their benefit for yourself.
Spore Field.MOD	DESC:Mushrooms grow from ground, slowing movement and sickening living creatures.
Spymaster's Coin.MOD	DESC:Hide a scrying sensor in a coin or other Tiny object for later activation.
Wall of Vermin.MOD	DESC:Wall of biting pests provides concealment, attacks anyone passing through.
Wand Modulation.MOD	DESC:Temporarily change wand to cast another, weaker spell.
Winged Watcher.MOD	DESC:You take the form of an owl (MM 277) or raven (MM 278), as chosen when you cast the spell.
